Loop & Fade (Digitakt I, OS 1.54)

The crossfader (src/xfade.c, src/xfade_store.c, src/xfade_glue.s) and the
looper's live features are by draadpiraat, GPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSE).

The looper (src/loop.c, src/loop.s and the headers beside them) is based on
sumedho's RAM Machines, GPL-2.0-or-later (LICENSE.GPL-2.0):
  RAM Machines 1.3.1 in repeat98/modwerk at ac085312a2354f45d343b0fc0cea2844c977026b
  (sdk/digitakt/modules/ram-machines), from https://github.com/sumedho/digirequests
  at 8eba613dc3e0b1698797609256fd4081923b4ef2 (modules/ram-machines).
  sumedho invited others to build on it:
  https://github.com/repeat98/modwerk/issues/1053#issuecomment-6712894195
Those files keep their GPL-2.0-or-later headers; this module as a whole is
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later, which their "or later" permits.

Core 3.0 header (src/digitakt-mk1/core3.h) and Core 2.1: irpina / Elekloader,
GPL-2.0-or-later. Machine Pages: irpina, adapted to Core 2.1 by sumedho.
src/digitakt-mk1/stock_knob.h: draadpiraat, GPL-3.0-or-later.

No Elektron firmware is included. Stock code is referenced by address, length
and SHA-256 only.
